{"sig":"rel_20260902121706342_02b02257b4|先别亏钱|到底亏在认知|策略或产品","releaseId":"rel_20260902121706342_02b02257b4","entities":{"先别亏钱":{"count":1,"hits":[{"n":11,"href":"books/proj-mt9svxu3n26/chapter-11.html","title":"能力边界的内视","excerpt":"…它只意味着，当一个投资者将他的全部交易记录加总分析时，这些交易作为一个整体创造的价值，在大多数情况下、对大多数人来说，低于它们消耗的成本。 先别亏钱在这个节点上展现出它最深层的那条纪律。它不是不买，不是不卖，不是把所有的钱都放在一张存折里。它是在每一次手指触碰到交易按钮之前，允许一个短暂…"}]},"到底亏在认知":{"count":0,"hits":[]},"策略或产品":{"count":0,"hits":[]}},"chapters":[{"n":1,"href":"books/proj-mt9svxu3n26/chapter-1.html","title":"账簿不撒谎"},{"n":2,"href":"books/proj-mt9svxu3n26/chapter-2.html","title":"斩花与留草"},{"n":3,"href":"books/proj-mt9svxu3n26/chapter-3.html","title":"交易的隐性课税"},{"n":4,"href":"books/proj-mt9svxu3n26/chapter-4.html","title":"时机的刻舟术"},{"n":5,"href":"books/proj-mt9svxu3n26/chapter-5.html","title":"风险的第一性原理"},{"n":6,"href":"books/proj-mt9svxu3n26/chapter-6.html","title":"杠杆的算术黑箱"},{"n":7,"href":"books/proj-mt9svxu3n26/chapter-7.html","title":"账簿的边界"},{"n":8,"href":"books/proj-mt9svxu3n26/chapter-8.html","title":"集中与深渊"},{"n":9,"href":"books/proj-mt9svxu3n26/chapter-9.html","title":"尾部的幽灵"},{"n":10,"href":"books/proj-mt9svxu3n26/chapter-10.html","title":"费用的复利暗流"},{"n":11,"href":"books/proj-mt9svxu3n26/chapter-11.html","title":"能力边界的内视"},{"n":12,"href":"books/proj-mt9svxu3n26/chapter-12.html","title":"他人亏损的镜子"},{"n":13,"href":"books/proj-mt9svxu3n26/chapter-13.html","title":"泡沫的集体语法"},{"n":14,"href":"books/proj-mt9svxu3n26/chapter-14.html","title":"纪律的考古学"},{"n":15,"href":"books/proj-mt9svxu3n26/chapter-15.html","title":"账簿的日常语法"},{"n":16,"href":"books/proj-mt9svxu3n26/chapter-16.html","title":"压力测试的诚实"},{"n":17,"href":"books/proj-mt9svxu3n26/chapter-17.html","title":"不亏钱的终局"}]}